Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:02:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dec-mom then got nice and told us that we\Ncould stay in Primary Village for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what happens next.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.61,0:02:15.03,Sign,TITLE,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Angemon Awakens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon! Awakens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's play a game\Nwith the baby Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am pledged to obey\Nyour command, Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you don't want to play any games.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Neomon's comeback?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom, bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon was always a good Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish there was some way\Nwe could get rid of the black
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gear that's causing him to\Nbe so mean that's easier said
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:03:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than done he's just way too\Nbig hello you've got company
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a nice little kid aren't\Nyou get your hide out here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i can get a good look at\Nyou because if you don't your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little friend here is gonna\Nsqueak his last squeak Patamon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we gotta save him poor leomon\Ni know he wouldn't attack us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if that stupid black ear didn't\Nhave him under an evil spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd come over to our side if we could\Nonly figure out a way to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to protect T.K. from Overmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's so big and I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been commanded by my\Nmaster to take the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came in time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it This little guy's\Ngonna get squished Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's staying with us.\NOver my stinky armpits,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will? Oh, I'm so scared!\NGet him, Greymon! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't anybody ever tell\Nyou not to play with fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone could get hurt, namely me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, to educate you, I'll show you\Nwho's the head honcho on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just bite you blindfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Black Gears!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn back, or he'll beat you to a pulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fist of the Beast King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fist of the Beast King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you, Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told the guy not to play with fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I command you to bring me the Digidestined,\Nstarting with the smallest child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am your humble servant\Nand will obey you, Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:05:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, move away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a prickly big zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, you gotta take it easy,\Nbuddy. I'm sorry. What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to protect\Nyou, and you were doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you're never going to believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have the consummate solution\Nto all of our problems that's cool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.08,0:06:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what are you talking about check\Nthem out they call them digivices
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they have the capability to completely\Nobliterate the black gear then
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's give them a try we have no\Nother choice right now we have to take
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a chance and stop him don't worry\Ni got you covered tk ready for a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,real fight huh what are you waiting\Nfor booger breath come on and get us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you dare what's up dude have you\Ntotally flipped out i must do as i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,am commanded come
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things pack quite a punch Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How they do that, rotten kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, over here! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've just begun to see our power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked! We destroyed\Nthe Black Gear! We're
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe now. Leomon's back\Nto his normal self.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those little fools are\Nkidding themselves they
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know who they're\Ndealing with they're
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna find out sooner\Nthan they think according
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to ancient legend our world will be taken
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over by a strange dark\Nforce that will change
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good Digimon into bad\Nones. Our ancestors have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,predicted that a group\Nof children called the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined will appear\Nfrom another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they will come to possess superpowers that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will eventually save our\Nworld from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe their prediction has come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,File Island has been seized by an evil
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in danger of destruction,\Nand now you've appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me, how can you be sure we're\Nthe kids you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do you have some proof\Nthat We're the same ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been foretold that the Digidestined
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.82,0:08:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have the ability to\Nmake Digimon digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done that, and\Nit's all the proof I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, for one, hope that it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My theory is that we'll be\Nreleased after we save the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once our purpose is served, there's\Nno other reason for us to remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll finally be able\Nto change these clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Leomon's information is correct,\Nwe'll be heading straight for home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we make it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not even sure who's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if it's a force that's\Ntoo big for us to handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Devimon is the\Nmain cause of all this evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To save the island, you're\Ngoing to have to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't defeat him,\Nit'll never be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's impossible for\Nus to lose with the Digivices.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first thing on my list\Nwhen i get home is to do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some killer shopping for\Nthat to happen we have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get you back home\Nif we all work together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're sure to win i'm\Nready anytime you are buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how about it matt are\Nwe up to the challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friend it's gonna be\Ntough when you get down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to it we have no other\Nchoice all right then
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,troops let's get to it\Nfar out it's a done deal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon is very powerful\NHe's brought nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But trouble to File\NIsland. We must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect that traitor\NLeomon is leading them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,directly into my trap he's\Nbeen very valuable to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i guess so but i'm\Nloyal and better looking
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen to me huh you will\Npay them one final visit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear this, Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power is infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hopes and dreams are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the supreme master of this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you dare to defy me, I will unleash the\Npowers of the universe and conquer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what's that? Big\Ntrouble's brewing. We'd better—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get ready for action\Nblack gear this is going
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be the big one joe it's\Ntime to show your true
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,self you feeling okay\Njoe just a little seasick
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Devimon I didn't\Nexpect him to be such a big
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guy Bad guys always seem to\Nthink bigger is better Pray not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power that Devimon possesses\Nis immense So be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Agumon, you better digivolve. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are cool
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to play silly games\Nwith you I'm far too wise for that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Vulcan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bullseye, you\NGomamon! Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no time to waste We've got\Nto strike right away Digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got it Ready, gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Digi-volve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's turn this guy into pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My biology teacher would love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do like the way our colors match!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast! Holy Blaster!\NI think he's got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Your attacks are\Npitiful, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll have to try\Nharder than that Electro
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucker! No, you don't want\Na needle spray, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up, you fools! It's\Nuseless! Oh, poor Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got no chance against\Nthe likes of us, kitty cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got no chance against\Nthe likes of us, kitty cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not worth my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:14:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nobody left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to get rid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have nothing to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say the smallest will destroy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it easy on both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Devimon, Supreme\NMaster of this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have power over all Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that guy knows how\Nto take it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my needles feel numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is probably not a\Ngood time to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it. It isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why can't I digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you, T.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that? It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Parrotmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parrotmon, Digivolve! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patamon finally digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's super cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little guy really had it in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice hair. Good color.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to take him home\Nwith me. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another foolish attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forces of good are more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even you can't stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you and\Nbring peace to the island
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light is so bright\NWhat are you doing to me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it I'm not going to allow\Nyou to take my power away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:18:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to fight me I'm\Nafraid I have no other choice
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can help others\NMy fate is unimportant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your powers have gotten far out of\Ncontrol and must be extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am ready to fight for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get him. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, pretty boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have used up all your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't very smart, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you are no use to anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away from the Dark Forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil is everywhere, so\Ndon't savor your victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are other Digimon that\Nare just as powerful as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of them are even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what you'll do\Nwhen you run into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't won at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K., I'll come back\Nagain, if you want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it could be Angemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just resting for a\Nwhile to regain his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see him again when he digi-falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make sure to take\Nreally good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life, Angemon. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the island is coming\Nback together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devamon's been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When evil is eliminated, the\Nisland returns to its normal state.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Devimon out of the\Nway, I can take over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, you're forgetting about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't the mad guys ever win?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with those other\Nevil Digimon across the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought we were going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to have to fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I broke a nail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, according to Leomon's\Nlegend, we've got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he said we're the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I've heard of you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say I'm pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir. Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you and what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.24,0:21:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, I'm just\Ngoing to see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:22:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is I'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.08,0:23:05.00,Sign,Next time on Digimon Adventure,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Set Sail – To a New Continent!

